{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21622","headline":"贻蜀五首 病马诗寄上李尚书 · 元稹","name":"贻蜀五首 病马诗寄上李尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里长鸣望蜀门，病身犹带旧疮痕。\n遥看云路心空在，久服盐车力渐烦。\n尚有高悬双镜眼，何由竝驾两朱轓。\n唯应夜识深山道，忽遇君侯一报恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}